Material adapted from FakeDataR
-------------------------------

Parts of the column name word lists in R/detect.R, DB_IDENTIFIER_NAME_WORDS and
DB_SENSITIVE_NAME_WORDS, are adapted from the FakeDataR package. Three ideas are
also taken from it and credited in README.md: recognising sensitive columns by
matching their names against a word list, printing a short description of the
fake data to paste into a chat, and validating the copy against the original by
comparing classes and missingness.

